<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 3 Best in Slot Gear list for Frost Mage DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Trial of the Grand Crusader. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3</h2>With the release of Phase 3 we now have <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> and an updated version of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=2159/onyxias-lair">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Onyxia's Lair</span></a>. These two raids provide plenty of new gear, both in the form of new best in slot items and very meaningful catch-up gear. Even though this is the case, because of the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/news/first-look-at-updated-item-level-gear-from-phase-2-wrath-classic-330040">buffed item level of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> items</a>, some of the items of Phase 2 will continue to be best in slot or at least close to the new best.<br/>
<br/>As a general rule, you want to aim for four-piece Tier 9 as soon as possible, for Horde this is the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=844/sunstriders-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Regalia</span></a> set, while for Alliance it's the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=843/khadgars-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Khadgar's Regalia</span></a> set, this is somewhat confusing but will be a theme for almost every new item. I personally play Horde, so when I mention any new item, you'll see that version, in the table below every blurb, you can see the two items within the same row.<br/>
<br/>This phase we also get new gems, and combined with the optimized socket bonuses of phase 3 items, you'll be using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40133/purified-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Dreadstone</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
