<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>In this phase, the new emblem is called <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a>. This will be mostly used to purchase the 232 or 245 item level version of Tier 9, but due to the currency cost being the same and the limited acquisition rate, you should not buy the 232 version of the Tier.<br/>
<br/>The 245 item level tier 9 requires more emblems, but also one <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> for any of the 5 items, these are obtainable in the Heroic 10-man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
