<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>Very similar to the Head slot, you'll aim for Tier 9 here without any off-piece alternative. The 258 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47767/sunstriders-shoulderpads-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Shoulderpads of Triumph</span></a> is the end-goal, but you can use the 245 ilvl version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47768/sunstriders-shoulderpads-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Shoulderpads of Triumph</span></a> temporarily until then. If you're just in early stages of gearing, you should try to get tier 8 shoulders, ideally <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46134/conquerors-kirin-tor-shoulderpads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_97.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Shoulderpads</span></a>, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45369/valorous-kirin-tor-shoulderpads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Kirin Tor Shoulderpads</span></a> is now the baseline for this slot since it's obtainable from heroic defense protocol beta dungeons.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
