<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47551/aethas-intensity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Aethas' Intensity</span></a> is the best in slot cloak, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47554/lady-liadrins-conviction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lady Liadrin's Conviction</span></a> a little behind by 20 dps. The same applies to their 10-man versions, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48666/drape-of-the-sunreavers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of the Sunreavers</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48667/shawl-of-the-devout-crusader">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shawl of the Devout Crusader</span></a> at 55 and 75 dps less than best in slot respectively making them great options. Especially considering how rare the 272 cloaks will be for a lot of guilds. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45618/sunglimmer-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunglimmer Cloak</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46321/sunglimmer-drape">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunglimmer Drape</span></a> are also relevant options to use temporarily, these two perform within 100-150 dps range of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47551/aethas-intensity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Aethas' Intensity</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47452/shroud-of-displacement">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Displacement</span></a> can help provide hit in this slot, this cloak is a great early alternative (70 dps less than best in slot) assuming you have good items on other slots that allow you to drop hit similar to what it provides. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45242/drape-of-mortal-downfall">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of Mortal Downfall</span></a> fills out the same goal but performs approximately 30 dps worse than the 258 option. Lastly, there's <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46042/drape-of-the-messenger">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of the Messenger</span></a> now becomes very easy to obtain through the new heroic defense protocol beta dungeons.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
