<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>In this slot you'll find the two best off-pieces, they perform similarly but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47462/skyweaver-vestments">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skyweaver Vestments</span></a> is easier to work with seeing as it'll provide a big portion of the total hit required for frost mage. If you're already hit capped through other alternative items (such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47482/boots-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Icy Floe</span></a>), then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47425/flowing-robes-of-ascent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flowing Robes of Ascent</span></a> performs 40 dps range of the best chest. If you're planning on using another off-piece such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a>, then using the tier 9 chest can be a solid option <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47766/sunstriders-robe-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Robe of Triumph</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Do note that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47604/merlins-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Merlin's Robe</span></a> will be easily obtainable and performs better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a> as an off-piece by about 20 dps, plus it also allows for easier swap later on with four piece <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-175/triumphant-sunstriders-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Triumphant Sunstrider's Regalia</span></a> already set up.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
