<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>The 258 ilvl tier 9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47763/sunstriders-gauntlets-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Gauntlets of Triumph</span></a> are best in slot gloves, not only do these have great stat distribution, but also provide powerful set bonuses. Until then you can use the 245 ilvl version of the same item, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47772/sunstriders-gauntlets-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Gauntlets of Triumph</span></a>. You can also use the 232 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47773/sunstriders-gauntlets-of-conquest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Gauntlets of Conquest</span></a> version, but I don't recommend buying these since it'll only delay you from obtaining the 245 ilvl item. If you happen to have it drop from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a>, then there's no reason not to use them as an upgrade.<br/>
<br/>You can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a> as an off-piece around four-piece tier 9, but as i mentioned in the chest section, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47604/merlins-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Merlin's Robe</span></a> performs slightly better and allows you to plan out your set better with the correct slots having tier ahead of time. Tier 8 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46132/conquerors-kirin-tor-gauntlets">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Gauntlets</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46131/valorous-kirin-tor-gauntlets">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Kirin Tor Gauntlets</span></a> should only be considered early upgrades if trying to catch up to current gear.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
