<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>The alternatives for belts aren't as competitive in comparison to other slots. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47419/belt-of-the-tenebrous-mist">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Tenebrous Mist</span></a> is the best belt this phase. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45619/starwatchers-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starwatcher's Binding</span></a> is the second best assuming you're hit capped as well. In the case that you do need hit, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47994/icehowl-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icehowl Binding</span></a> is the best option, only 40 dps less than best in slot. in the same situation, you can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47447/belt-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Biting Cold</span></a>, but not only does it perform worse, it's also far more contested.<br/>
<br/>As for catch-up, both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45557/sash-of-ancient-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Ancient Power</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45558/cord-of-the-white-dawn">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_40b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the White Dawn</span></a> will continue to be the bare minimum you should get before entering a raid.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
