<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>The 258 ilvl tier 9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47765/sunstriders-leggings-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Triumph</span></a> are best in slot legs. Until then you can use the 245 ilvl version of the same item, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47770/sunstriders-leggings-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Triumph</span></a>. You can also use the 232 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47775/sunstriders-leggings-of-conquest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Conquest</span></a> version, but I don't recommend buying these since it'll only delay you from obtaining the 245 ilvl item. If you happen to have it drop from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a>, then there's no reason not to use them as an upgrade.<br/>
<br/>Alternatively, you can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47435/pants-of-the-soothing-touch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pants of the Soothing Touch</span></a> as an off-piece option with four-piece <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-175/triumphant-sunstriders-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Triumphant Sunstrider's Regalia</span></a> on the surrounding slots. This performs only 40 dps worse than the best in slot <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47462/skyweaver-vestments">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skyweaver Vestments</span></a>, with the added benefit that it's far less contested. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47770/sunstriders-leggings-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Triumph</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> are also options here same circumstances, but these two provide hit making them slightly more awkward to use - even then they're within 100-150 dps range of the best off-piece.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
